          "title": "《宋史》卷四百零四·張運傳",
          "source_bid": "d59f2gonq7sy",
          "details": "乃授集英殿修撰，出知太平州。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "office_id": "hixia8n7evb4",
      "text": "少師",
      "posthumous": true,
